    {
      "id": "graph-projection",
      "kind": "concept",
      "label": {
        "zh": "GraphProjection",
        "en": "GraphProjection"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "当前 Rust 引擎已经实现内部 GraphProjection：它确定性生成 revision、concept、claim、procedure 和匿名 evidence 节点，以及语义、引用、冲突关系与连续的学习事件。投影固定声明 human-review 和 agentGraphAccess: false，并绑定精确 revision、语义摘要、projector generation 与投影摘要。证据节点不含原文、摘录、定位、来源 ID 或路径；但内部语义文案仍可能敏感，因此该 JSON 不能直接发布。",
        "en": "The Rust engine now implements an internal GraphProjection. It deterministically builds revision, concept, claim, procedure, and opaque-evidence nodes plus semantic, citation, and conflict edges and contiguous learning events. The projection fixes human-review and agentGraphAcces…"
      },
      "status": "compiled",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "document-architecture",
        "document-privacy"
      ],
      "weight": 12
    },
